  m_text: "A pi\xF1ata is a container, often made of papier-m\xE2ch\xE9, pottery,
    or cloth, that is decorated, filled with candy, and then broken as part of a
    celebration. \n\nPi\xF1atas are commonly associated with Mexico."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
